 "limitations": [
  "Literature is abstract-level only; late denominators unverified.",
  "VNS pooled/registry data include non-focal epilepsy.",
  "Virtual-patient arm not run: vep-stim failed reproduction (A0095) and synthetic recovery (A0097); R5 verdict NOT QUALIFIED (A0098), causes include non-identifiability, prior conflict, iid likelihood on AR(1) noise, multimodality. P3-P5 not run; predictions never frozen; V008/V009 never opened.",
  "Only 10 of 56 eligible ds004100 cases curated; coordinate template identity to_verify; trailing constant EDF pad in 21 of 61 runs, all ictal (21 of 41 ictal runs) (A0094).",
  "Outcome exposure: discovery roles read participants files before sealing (V001-V007); aggregates on record in superseded A0033/A0058 (ds004100 S36/F22, by therapy), A0040 (277 known), A0035 (5 NR), A0038 (10-46 mo follow-up). Leakage-risk path for any future outcome evaluation on the A0071 split.",
  "Omni-iEEG (A0040) overlaps ds004100, ds003498, ds003029 and ds003876 and is not independent of them.",
  "Controller design gaps for next release: summaries cannot cite same-task artifacts; repair marks consuming ValidationReports and ReviewDecisions stale too eagerly."
